<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatiate</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatiate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Jesu Khrist leh misi lak a kipan a kaithoupa, Pa Pathian ziak a sawltak, mihing sawlkhiak hilou, mihing vanga leng hi sam lou,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />leh ka kiang a unau om tengtengte’n, Galatia gam a saptuamte kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh i Toupa Jesu Khrist apan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman i Pathian leh a Pa deihdan in, tulai khovel gilou tak lak a a hon suahtaksak theihna ding in i khelhnate ading in amah mah a hong kipeta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian kiang ah thupina tangtawn in om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist hehpihna ziak a nou honsampa huchi guih a Tanchinhoih tuam lam a na kisuan san uh lamdang ka sa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tanchinhoih dang om ahi kei a; noumau hon hihbuai in Khrist Tanchinhoih hih lamdan ut kuate hiam a om uh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh koumau hiam, van a kipan a hongsuk angel nangawn in leng, Tanchinhoih na kiang ua ka gensa pen loungal uh Tanchinhoih dang himhim hon na hilhta a om uleh hamsiat in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuma a ka gen bang un, tua gennawn ding ka hi. Tanchinhoih na muh pen loungal uh, Tanchinhoih dang kuapeuh in nou a honhilh leh hamsiat in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihleh tuin mihing maipha hia ka zon Pathian a? Ahihkeileh mihing ahi maw lungtaisak ka tup? Mihing nana lungtaisak lel hitaleng, Khrist sikha ka hi kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, ka Tanchinhoih genpen mihing lamthu ahi kei chih k’on theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing kiang a kipan a ka muh leng ahi kei, mi honhilh leng ka hi sam kei, Jesu Khrist kilakna ziak a mu ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judate sabiakdan a nidanglai ka omdan na thei khinta ngal ua, huchi a Pathian saptuamte nakpitak a sawi in ka hihbuai gige hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ka pipute thugousiah tung a phatuam ka ngaih tuankhol ziak in Judate sabiakdan lam ah ka chipihte lak a ka khanvual tampite ka na khengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nu gilsung a kipan a hon hihtuampa leh a hehpihna ziak a honsampa Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentelte lak a a Tanchinhoih ka hilh theihna ding a a Tapa lungkimtak a keimah a a kilaksak lai in, sa leh sisan toh kidong lou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawltak ka hih ma a sawltak nana hisate kiang a Jerusalem khua a hohtou tuanlou in, Arabia gam ah ka paimang paha; huan Damaska khua ah ka kik nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum thum a beinung in Kifa veh ding in Jerusalem khua ah ka vahoh tou a, a kiang ah ni sawmlehnga ka tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sawltak dangte, Toupa unau Jakob kia loungal kuamah ka mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka thugelhte ngai dih ua, Pathian mitmuh ah ka zuau kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai nung in Suria leh Silisia gamte ah ka hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judia gam a saptuam, Khrist a omte meltheih ka hi naikei lai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuma lam a hon sawipan tuma a khatvei ginna thu a hihbuai tuh tuin a gen zawta” chih mi gen kia a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan keimah ziak in Pathian a pahtawita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmlehli a beinung in Titas mah leng pi in, Barnaba toh Jerusalem khua ah ka va hohtou nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilakna ziak in ka va hohtou a, Jentelte kiang a Tanchinhoih ka tangkoupih amau ka vahilh a; himahleh milian deuhte a tuam in ka hilh a; huchilou in zaw a thawn in ka taikha hiam ahihkeileh taithawnta ka hi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh ka kiang a om Titas, hial leng Grik mi himahleh zeksum sak teitei in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai unau taklou, a guk a pilut a omte, sal a honlak theihna ding ua Khrist Jesu a noplenna i neih uh enkhe ding a honglutte ziak in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Tanchinhoih thutak nou ading a bittak a kep a hihtheihna ding in amau kiang ah mitphiatkal lel leng ka kipe himhim kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hihna deuh min nei mahmahte bangchibang hihna nei mahle uh kei ading in a lamdan na a omkei hi. Pathian in kuamah a khentuam kei hi; huai min nei mahmahte thugen in bangmah hon behlap kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchih naksang in zeksumte kiang a Tanchinhoih Peter kiang a kepsak a a om bang in zeksumlouhte kiang a Tanchinhoih kei kiang ah kepsakin a om chih a theizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zeksumte sawltak hi ding a Peter a sempa mah in Jentelte sawltak hi ding in kei ah a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan hehpihna kei kiang a piak a om a muh un, Jakob, Kifa, Johan, khuam muanhuai leh min neite’n amau bel zeksumte kiang a hoh ding leh kou Jentelte kiang a hoh di’n kei leh Barnaba kithuahna khut taklam honpe zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gentheite ka theih gige lel uh a deih ua, huai mah hih ka tum chiltel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan Peter tuh Antiok khua a a hongpai lai in demhuai mahmah a a om ziak in a maitang ngei ah ka kalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi kuate hiam Jakob kiang a kipan a a hongpai ma un aman Jentelte kiang ah an a ne zel hi; himahleh a hong tuntak un zeksumte a kihtak ziak in pang nawnlou in a ki koihtuamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda dangte leng a lepchiah chiat sam ua, huchi in Barnaba hilhial leng a lepchiahna ua pimang in a om zou hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tanchinhoih thutak bang in a omkei uh chih ka theih in avek ua ma ah Peter kiang ah, “Nang Judami na hi ngal a, Judate om bang a omlou in Jentelte om bang a na om zawk leh bangchidan ahia Jentelte Judate om bang a na omsak teitei nak?“ ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ei zaw Jentel mikhialte hilou in, Judami him a piang i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh dan thilhihte ziak in mi siamtang in a omkei hi, Jesu Khrist gin ziak kia in siamtang in omzaw uh chih i thei uhi; enleng dan thilhih ziak hilou in, Khrist ginna ziak a siamtang a i om theihna ding in, Khrist Jesu i gingta hi; dan thilhihte ziak in mihing himhim siamtang a omlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihleh Khrist a siamtang a om tum kawmpi a eite mikhialte i na hih nak leh Khrist khelhna omsakpa hita ve maw le! Hilou hial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thil hihsiatte ka lamnawn zel in zaw, talekpa ka hi chih ka kitheisak phet ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian lam adia ka hong hin theihna ding in, kei zaw dan ziak in dan lam ah ka si khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khrist toh kilhden in ka omta; himahleh ka hing ahi; keimah pen ka hita kei a, Khrist keimah ah a hing ahizaw; tua sa a ka hin bel ginna a hing ka hi; Pathian Tapa, hon it a ka sik a kipepa pen ginna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian hehpihna bangmahlou in ka bawl kei, dan ziak a diktatna a om in zaw Khrist a thawn a si ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou Galatia mihaite aw, kuan hon bumhai a maizen a? Na mitmuh ngei ua Jesu Khrist kilhden a kichiantak a latsak a hihhih toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai leltak k’on dong ding: Dan thilhihte ziak in hia Kha na muh uh, na ngaihkhiak ua na gintak ziak un?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichitelin na hai umaw? Kha a pankhin ngal in, sa in na zou ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil huchizah zah a thawn a thuak na hi umaw? A thawn hi taktak hita leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kiang ua Kha hon pepa leh na lak ua thillamdang hihpan dan thilhihte ziak in hia a hih, na ngaihkhiak ua na gintak ziak un?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Abraham in Pathian a gingta a, huai ginna diktatna a simsak a hihtak mah bang in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in thei un, ginna a omte Abram tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Laisiangthou in, “Pathian in ginna ziak in Jentelte siamtang sak ding in a kisa chih theikhol in, nangmah ah namte vualzawlsak in a om ding uh” chi in, Abraham kiang ah Tanchinhoih a na genkholta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in ginna a omte a ginompa Abraham toh vualzawl sak in a omsam nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dan thilhih a kinga peuhmahte hamse nuai ah a om uhi; “Dan laibu a thugelh tengteng bang a hih gige lou peuhmah hamsiat in om hen,” chi a, gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin Pathian mitmuh in kuamah dan a siamtang a omkei, “Mi diktat tuh ginna in a hing ding” chih a hih ziak in chih a lang kilkel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh dan ginna a kinga ahi kei; huchibang a hihpa huaite in a hing ding chih ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist ei sik a hamsiat in a hongom a, dan hamsia a kipan in a hontan kheta hi; “Sing a khailup peuhmah hamsiat hi hen” chih gelh a hih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi a Abraham tung a vualzawlnate Khrist Jesu ziak a Jentelte tung a hongtun theih a, Kha chiam ginna ziak a i muh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaute aw, mihing hihdan gen leng: mihing thukhun lel leng, hihkipsa nung a phelkei ua, behlap leng a behlap ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham kiang ah leh a chisuan kiang ah thuchiamte piak a na hi. Mi tampi tungthu gen bang in, “Chisuante kiang ah” a chi kei a; mi khat tungthu gen bang in, “Nang chisuan kiang ah,” a chi zaw a, huai tuh Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in hiai ka chi ahi: huai thuchiam bangmahlou suaksak a hihmang ding in, thukhun Pathian in a na hihkipsa, a nung kum za li leh sawmthum khita hongom dan in a hihmang theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gouluah ding thu dan ziak ahihleh thuchiam ziak ahita kei ding a; himahleh Pathian in Abraham kiang ah thuchiam ziak in ahi a na piak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihkeileh bangchi thu a dan om ahia leh? Chisuan, thuchiamna a hongom masiah tatleknate ziak in behlap in a om a, angelte zang a palai khut a hihkip ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan palai himhim mi khat lak ah palai ahi ngeikei hi; Pathian bel khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihkeileh dan in Pathian thuchiam te a kalh hia? Kalh lou hial, dan mi hihhing thei himhim piak a omkhin hitaleh, diktatna dan ziak in a om ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Jesu Khrist gin ziak a thilchiam a gingtate kiang a piak a hihtheihna ding in Laisiangthou in khelhna nuai ah bangkim a khakkhum vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh ginna a hong tunma in ginna hong kilangding ah khakkhum in dan nuai a ven i na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in ginna ziak a siam i tan theihna ding in dan Khrist kiang a honchilpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh ginna a hongtun in, honchilpa nuai ah i omta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khrist Jesu gin ziak in Pathian tate na hi vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Noute Khrist a baptist lut a omsate Khrist in na kithuamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai ah Judami a omkei a, Grik mi leng a omkei; huai ah sikha a omkei a, noplen leng a omkei; huai ah pasal leh numei leng a omkei hi. Khrist Jesu ah na vek un pumkhat na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huan Khrist a na hih uleh Abraham suan, thuchiam bang a gouluah dingte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh huchi in ka chi: Gouluah dingpa bangkim tung ah toupa himahleh naupang a hih laiteng sikha toh bangmah in a ki lamdang kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pa hunseh a hongtun masiah a donpa leh a kempa nuai ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchibang in ei leng naupang i hihlai in, khovel thubulte nuai ah sikha in i om uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh a hunbi a hong kim in, Pathian in a Tapa, numei suan in, dan nuai a hongsuak in a hon sawlkhia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ta hihna i muh theihna ding leh dan nuai a omte tankhe ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan tate na hih ziak un Pathian in a Tapa Kha, “Abba, Pa,” chi a kikou in, i lungtang uah a honsawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in sikha na hita kei ua, ta na hi zawta uhi; huan ta na hihleh Pathian vanga gouluah ding na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian na theihlouh lai un, a piandan mawng ua Pathian hilou hialte sikha na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua Pathian n’on theihnung un bel, ahihkeileh Pathian theihmi na hong hihnung un chih ding ahizaw; thubul zawngkhal leh namanloute nuai a bangchidan a bawi a om nawn na ut na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nite, khate, hunte, kumte na tang zel ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tung uah tha ka sengthawn kha ding chih ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute aw, k’on ngen ahi, keimah bang in om un, keileng noumau bang in ka om a, ka bangmah na hihse kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tanchinhoih na kiang ua ka gen masakna pen ka sa hatlouh ziak ahi chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ka sa a nou dia khemna om tuh na simmawh kei ua, na kih sam kei uh; Pathian angel bang leh Khrist Jesu bang hial in n’on pakta zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vangpha na kisakna uh koi a omta ahia le? Hihtheih liai hileh na mit uh khelkhia in n’on pekhin ding uh chih k’on theihpih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thutak k’on hilh ziak in na melma uh ka hong hita ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amau noute phatuamngaitak in, a hoihlam deih hilou napi in a honzawl uhi; ahi, amau adia na phattuamngaih theihna ding ua kou a kipan pawsiah a hon omsak a ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tup a hoih leh a hoih lam ah chiklai peuh in phatuamngaih gige a hoih hi, na kiang ua ka omlai kia hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, Khrist noumau a siam piching a a om masiah nauvei in ka honvei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi, tulaiin na kiang ua om a, ka aw hihlamdan ka ut theihdan; na tungthu uah ka mang a bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan nuai a om utte aw, honhilh un, dan in a gen na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hichibang a gelh ahi: Abraham in tapa nih a nei a, khat sikhanu toh khat noplennu toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh sikhanu lak a pen sa dan in a pianga, noplennu lak a pen bel thuchiam ziak a piang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai thilte etsakna ahi; huai numeite thukhun nih ahi uhi; khat Sinai tang a sikha hi ding a ta neinu, Hagar ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan Hagar bel Arabia gam a Sinai tang ahi a, Jerusalem tulai a om toh kibang ahi, a tate toh sikha in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tunglam Jerusalem bel noplen ahi; huai ngeingei eite nu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nang ching, ta nei ngeilou, nuam in, nang, nauvei ngeilou, kikou khia in; pasal neinu sang in lungzuangnu tate a tamzaw ngal a” chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, eite Isak bang in thuchiam tate i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh huailai bang in tuin leng ahi; sa dan a piang in Kha dan a piang a sawi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh Laisiangthou in bangchi’n a gen a? Bawinu a tapa toh hawlkhia un; bawinu tapa in noplennu tapa gou a luahpih louhding ziak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, bawinu tate i hi kei ua, noplennu tate i hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noplen ding in Khrist in a hon suakta sakta, huaiziak in ding kip unla, sikha hakkol ah zaw lutnawn kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai un kei Paul in na kiang ua ka gen, zek na sum uleh Khrist nou ading in bangmah phattuamna hilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi a, danthu tengteng zui ding a bate a na hi uh chih zeksumte tengteng kiang ah ka theisak nawn ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou dan a siamtan tumte aw, Khrist toh kikhenta na hi uh, hehpihna na puksanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kou bel Kha ziak in ginna in diktanna lametna ka ngak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist Jesu ah zeksum bangmah a phatuam kei a, zeksumlouh leng bangmah a phatuam sam kei; ginna itna a sem bel a phatuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hoihtak in na tailai un thutak zuihlou ding a kuan a hondal a ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai zekhemna zaw nou honsampa kiang a kipan ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Silngou tawmchik in tanghou beupi a zelsuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ngaihtuahna banglou in na ngaihtuah lamdang tuankei ding uh chih Toupa ah k’on muang hi; himahleh nou hon hihbuaite, a kua a kua hitale uh vaihawmna a tung ua kia pen a thuak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, ken zeksum thu gen lailai ka hih in, bangziaka sawi a om ka hia? Huchibang a hihngal leh Kros kisuihna tuh hihmang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou hon hihbuaite satkhiakin om vanglak le uh ka deih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou unaute aw, sikha hilou ding in sap na hi ua; himahleh na sikha hihlouhna uh sa ading a lemtanna’n zangkei unla, itna in akua akua ading a kisepsakte hizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah na ki-it bang in na vengte na it ding ahi, chih thu kam khat ah danthu tengteng kimsakin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh na kikeih ua, na kinektuah uleh na kinekgaih louhna ding un pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in hiai ka chi ahi, Kha ah om un, huchi in sa utna na hih tangtung kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sa in Kha a dou nak a, Kha in leng sa a dou hi; thilhih na tupte uh na hih theihlouhna ding un huaite a kikalh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Kha pi a na om uleh dan nuai ah na omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan sa thilhihte a kilang chian hi, huaite hiaite ahi uh: angkawmna, kingaihna, thanghuaina, hukna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milim biakna, bumna, huatna, kinakna, hazatna, hehna, kilanna, omtuamna, gintuamna
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Deihgohna, tualthahna, zumun nopna, zukhamna, huchibang thilhih chingte’n Pathian gam a tangkei ding uh chi a tuma a k’on hilhkholh mah bang in, k’on hilhkhol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kha gah ahihleh, itna, kipahna, lemna, thuaktheihna, migitna, hoihna, muanhuaina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nunnemna, kidektheihnate a hizaw uhi; huchibang kalh lam in danthupiak himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a hitate’n sa a lunggulhna leh a duhgawlna toh a kilhdenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kha a hing i hihleh kha mah ah i om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kitoutuah chiat a, kihaza chiat in, i ki koihlian kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, mi takhial bangpeuh a hihlai phawka na om leh nou kha mite aw, khemna ka tuaksam kha ding e, chi a kiveng hoih kawm in, huai bang mi nunnemna lungsim toh tungding thak nawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na puakgikte uh kidawn chiat un, huchi in Khrist danthu na zui uh ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi bangmah hiloupi in mi liankuama a kibawl leh amah kikhem tawm lel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Michih in amah thilhih enchian hen; huchi a midang toh kiteha, kiuangsak lou a, amah mah a suanhuai thil a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Michih in amah puak paw ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuhilh a om in thil hoih tengteng a hilhpa kiang ah pe sam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zekhem in omkei un; Pathian zaw zekhem a mawkbawl vual ahi kei; min a tuh peuh uh huai mah at nawn ngei ding a hih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah salam a tuh in sa a om siatna a at ding a, khalam a tuh in bel kha a kipan tangtawn hinna a at ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in thil hoih hih chimtak keini; i lungkiak kei leh a huntak ah i at ngei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in lemtang hun i neihdan bangzel in mi tengteng tung ah thil hoih hih ni, ginna inkuanpihte lak a omte tung ah hi kholdiak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimah khut mahmah a na kiang ua laimal golpi pi a ka gelh en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sa a mel kilawmsak utte peuhmah in zeksum a om ding in nou a honsawl teitei nak uhi; bangmah dang ziak ahi kei a, Khrist Kros ziak a sawi a thuak louhna ding lel uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeksumte nangawn in leng danthu a zui tuansam kei ua, na sa uah, suan ding a neih theihna ding un na zek uh kisum leh chih a ut lel uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ken zaw i Toupa Jesu Khrist Kros loungal ka suan louh ding dan, huai Kros ziak in khovel kei ading in kilhden in a om a, keileng khovel a ding in kilhden in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siamthak nawnna louzaw zeksum bangmah ahi kei a, zeksumlouh leng bangmah ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai dan bang a om peuhmahte tung ah lemna leh hehpihna, Israelte Pathian tung ngei ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuban siah kuamah in hon hihbuai nawn kei hen; ka pumpi ah Jesu chiamtehnate ka pu ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaute aw, Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na kha uah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
